(text "2.2k per die: conservative low current, NOT constant brightness. No boost: blue/white may dim on CR2032." (at 25.4 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "1eebb321-5e0b-5052-87fb-1f2871769070"))
(text "Programming: remove battery; single 5V supply, max 5.5V. ISP may light LEDs; current resistors remain in circuit." (at 25.4 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "fa0b49a6-9c52-5a6a-b944-4ce2480eddf5"))
